(map[string]bool also works and reads more simply: if seen["go"] {...})

▸  A COUNTER
    counts := map[rune]int{}
    for _, r := range text { counts[r]++ }

▸  GROUPING
    byLen := map[int][]string{}
    for _, w := range words {
        byLen[len(w)] = append(byLen[len(w)], w)   // nil slice -> append
    }

▸  STRUCT VALUES CAN'T BE EDITED IN PLACE
